# Crest: DevTools remote debugging for browser automation (Playwright,
# Puppeteer, ChromeDriver), limited to the one Arma profile the person chose.
# Chromium's default browser context is whichever profile it used last, which
# in Arma is unloaded or a Space nobody chose, so Playwright's first command
# failed; and every profile's tabs were visible to a remote client. The
# engine reads Arma's automation setting at startup, makes the chosen profile
# the default context, places the contexts DevTools creates in its Space, and
# hides every other target from remote clients only. See crest_automation.h.

